  10 episodes all synthesized in ONE locked MiniMax-H3 voice (the blind-test
  demo). The same voice_id is referenced by every item; the point is that
  episode 11 would still audibly match episode 3.
  This is the shape `lanyin export rss` produces for the xiaoyuzhou platform (m3).
-->
